<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>관리자 마스터 대시보드 - 프레시 마켓</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./stylesheets/style.css">
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; background-color: #f3f4f6; color: #111827; }
        header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 18px 40px; background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .header-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 35px; }
        .header-left h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.4em; font-weight: 800; color: #10b981; }

        nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
        nav a { text-decoration: none; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95em; transition: color 0.2s; }
        nav a:hover { color: #10b981; }

        .admin-container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
        .dashboard-title { font-size: 1.8em; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 30px; }

        .section-card { background: white; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 20px; padding: 30px; margin-bottom: 35px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.01); }
        .section-card h3 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.3em; border-bottom: 2px solid #f3f4f6; padding-bottom: 12px; color: #111827; }

        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
        th { background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #4b5563; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left; }
        td { padding: 14px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-size: 0.95em; }

        .btn-toggle-add { background-color: #ebfdf5; color: #10b981; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .btn-toggle-add:hover { background-color: #10b981; color: white; }

        .btn-toggle-remove { background-color: #fff7ed; color: #ea580c; border: 1px solid #ffedd5; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .btn-toggle-remove:hover { background-color: #ea580c; color: white; }

        .btn-green { background-color: #10b981; color: white; border: none; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
        .btn-red { background-color: #fee2e2; color: #ef4444; border: none; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .btn-red:hover { background-color: #ef4444; color: white; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="header-left">
        <h1>🌱 프레시 마켓 [관리자 모드]</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="./">홈</a>
            <a href="./shop/products">추천상품</a>
            <a href="./shop/products/all">전체상품</a>
            <a href="./shop/cart">장바구니</a>
            <a href="./post/list">고객센터</a>
            <a href="./admin" style="color: #ef4444; font-weight: 700;">👑 관리자 대시보드</a>
        </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="auth-zone">
        <span style="font-weight: bold; color: #d97706;">👑 총괄 마스터 가동 중</span> |
        <a href="./" style="text-decoration: none; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 600;">사용자 홈 바로가기</a> |
        <a href="./logout" style="color: #ef4444; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">로그아웃</a>
    </div>
</header>

<div class="admin-container">
    <div class="dashboard-title">🎛️ 마스터 통합 제어 센터</div>

    <div class="section-card">
        <h3>✨ 1. 전체 상품 진열 및 추천 리스트 관리</h3>
        <table>
            <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 10%;">이모지</th>
                <th style="width: 25%;">과일명</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">판매가</th>
                <th style="width: 25%;">현재 추천 상태</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">추천 제어 스위치</th>
            </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
            <% products.forEach(product => { %>
                <tr>
                    <td><span style="font-size: 1.4em;"><%= product.emoji %></span></td>
                    <td><strong style="color: #111827;"><%= product.name %></strong></td>
                    <td style="font-weight: 600;"><%= product.price.toLocaleString() %>원</td>
                    <td>
                        <% if (product.is_featured === 1 || product.is_featured === true) { %>
                            <span style="color: #d97706; background-color: #fffbeb; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85em;">⭐️ 추천 리스트 노출 중</span>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <span style="color: #6b7280; background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85em;">일반 상품 상태</span>
                        <% } %>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <form action="./admin/product/toggle-featured" method="POST" style="display:inline;">
                            <input type="hidden" name="productId" value="<%= product.id %>">
                            <input type="hidden" name="currentFeatured" value="<%= product.is_featured %>">

                            <% if (product.is_featured === 1 || product.is_featured === true) { %>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn-toggle-remove">❌ 추천 리스트 삭제</button>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn-toggle-add">⭐️ 추천 리스트 추가</button>
                            <% } %>
                        </form>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            <% }) %>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="section-card">
        <h3>📦 2. 고객 주문 현황 및 배송 상태 관리</h3>
        <table>
            <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>주문번호</th>
                <th>주문자 ID</th>
                <th>결제금액</th>
                <th>현재 상태</th>
                <th>상태 변경</th>
            </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
            <% if(orders.length > 0) { %>
                <% orders.forEach(order => { %>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code><%= order.order_number %></code></td>
                        <td>👤 <%= order.username %></td>
                        <td><strong style="color: #111827;"><%= order.total_price.toLocaleString() %>원</strong></td>
                        <td>
                            <% if(order.status === '배송완료') { %>
                                <span style="color: #10b981; font-weight: bold; background-color: #f0fdf4; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px;"><%= order.status %></span>
                            <% } else if(order.status === '배송중') { %>
                                <span style="color: #2563eb; font-weight: bold; background-color: #eff6ff; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px;"><%= order.status %></span>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <span style="color: #d97706; font-weight: bold; background-color: #fffbeb; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px;"><%= order.status %></span>
                            <% } %>
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            <form action="./admin/order/update" method="POST" style="display:inline-flex; gap: 6px;">
                                <input type="hidden" name="orderId" value="<%= order.id %>">
                                <select name="status" style="padding: 6px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
                                    <option value="배송준비중" <%= order.status==='배송준비중'?'selected':'' %>>배송준비중</option>
                                    <option value="배송중" <%= order.status==='배송중'?'selected':'' %>>배송중</option>
                                    <option value="배송완료" <%= order.status==='배송완료'?'selected':'' %>>배송완료</option>
                                </select>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn-green" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.85em; border-radius: 6px;">적용</button>
                            </form>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                <% }) %>
            <% } else { %>
                <tr><td colspan="5" style="text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; padding: 30px 0;">들어온 주문 내역이 아직 없습니다.</td></tr>
            <% } %>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="section-card">
        <h3>👥 3. 활성 회원 명부 및 권한 통제</h3>
        <table>
            <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>고객 고유코드</th>
                <th>회원 ID</th>
                <th>가입 일자</th>
                <th>매니지먼트</th>
            </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
            <% if(users && users.length > 0) { %>
                <% users.forEach(u => { %>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="color: #9ca3af;"># <%= u.id || u.username %></td>
                        <td><strong style="color: #111827;">👤 <%= u.username || u.id %></strong></td>
                        <td style="color: #6b7280;"><%= u.reg_date || '방금 가입' %></td>
                        <td>
                            <form action="./admin/user/delete" method="POST" style="display:inline;" onsubmit="return confirm('정말로 이 회원을 강제 탈퇴시키겠습니까?');">
                                <input type="hidden" name="userId" value="<%= u.id %>">
                                <button type="submit" class="btn-red">회원 삭제</button>
                            </form>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                <% }) %>
            <% } else { %>
                <tr><td colspan="4" style="text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; padding: 30px 0;">가입된 일반 회원이 없습니다.</td></tr>
            <% } %>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>